      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the past 20 years, mindfulness has been incorporated into a number of psychological treatments for mental and physical health conditions. Nurses are now teaching mindfulness to patients in a variety of settings. This article describes the concept of mindfulness, some of the clinical populations that have been treated with this technique, a script for a simple introductory mindfulness exercise and a case study to illustrate its use."},
